{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic journey of mystical mastery in <i>Mage Blast</i>! This indie pixel-art idle/incremental game puts you in the robes of a powerful mage, progressing through an arcane world of limitless potential. Hone your skills, craft legendary artifacts, and build an unstoppable arsenal of magical spells and modifiers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Master Your Magic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/077b8f3b91eea9db67a99a86ca808910.poster.avif?t=1756027724\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/077b8f3b91eea9db67a99a86ca808910.webm?t=1756027724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/077b8f3b91eea9db67a99a86ca808910.mp4?t=1756027724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train and upgrade your skills to unleash ever-greater magical power. Experiment with different playstyles to discover the most efficient path to ascension.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd28 <strong>Crafting: The Key to Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/7bf5c237212e5d76056669bcf07c08d3.poster.avif?t=1756027724\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/7bf5c237212e5d76056669bcf07c08d3.webm?t=1756027724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/7bf5c237212e5d76056669bcf07c08d3.mp4?t=1756027724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge powerful artifacts and magical items to unlock new abilities and deepen your mastery. Craft specialized attack modifiers to further enhance your spellcasting potential.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Expand and Enhance Your Spells</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/6a1e95f61ebdb24fac0c41e4de625b1a.poster.avif?t=1756027724\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/6a1e95f61ebdb24fac0c41e4de625b1a.webm?t=1756027724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/6a1e95f61ebdb24fac0c41e4de625b1a.mp4?t=1756027724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a diverse arsenal of spells, each with unique attributes. Strengthen and refine them to deal massive damage and dominate your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With stunning pixel visuals, an engaging progression system, and endless possibilities, <i>Mage\u00a0 Blast</i>\u00a0is the ultimate magical journey for idle game enthusiasts. Will you rise as the ultimate arcane master?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650180?t=1756027724","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/e12d27549a32202b88b8b56ea29663e193a41bcf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756027724","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/eabf7666e7043cb4da867f847aecb07e68f5ba10/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756027724","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/eabf7666e7043cb4da867f847aecb07e68f5ba10/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1